      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "Blinds and stuns instead of killing. Players caught in the flash go blind, then reel; mobs are slowed and weakened and forget who they were hunting. It does no damage and breaks no blocks, which makes it perfect for clearing a camp.\n\nSixteen come out of one MV Assembler run of two aluminum plates, four magnesium dust and two gunpowder. The fuse is only two seconds, and a wall between you and the blast blocks the flash entirely.\n\n[note]Turn your back before it pops. The flash is strongest when you are looking at it. It affects the thrower too.[/note]",
